MEDICAL DISCLAIMER
-----------------------------------------------------------------
This course is an educational resource for health professionals and students.
It is not clinical decision support and must not be used to direct the care of
an individual patient. The interactive tools are teaching objects: where a
validated clinical calculator exists, the tools deliberately do not reproduce
it and instead direct the learner to the official instrument. Guideline
thresholds, drug doses and trial results are current to August 2026 and will
become outdated — see the maintenance schedule and verification log at the
About page within the course. Always consult the primary guideline document
and the current product information before treating a patient.
